      "message": "Is it okay that DynamicLib::Close will be called when this goes out of scope? This calls `::FreeLibrary` on Windows, and `dlclose` on non-Windows... does that potentially uninject the library from the process? Maybe we need to make this a static variable to keep it alive.",
